From 6fe587dd148be43b98e558ba6e89a3422c54c9db Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: raold <868138+raold@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 06:23:38 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 11/11] Let other modules keep bots' follow spots off ground
 hazards

A module may install a PlayerbotHazardFilter. FollowAction then lets it
move a formation spot that lies in a hazard to a safe spot nearby, and
avoid aoe asks it, after the stock cases, where to step out of a hazard
the bot stands in. Nothing changes until a filter is installed.
---
